<title>USA: Aon unit enters Japanese market.</title>
<headline>Aon unit enters Japanese market.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aon Corp said Tuesday its Aon Warranty Group formed a Japanese business unit.</p>
<p>Aon Warranty Group-Japan, headquarteredin Tokyo, will provide service contract programs to the automotive, computer, electronics and appliance industries in Japan.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
